            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mexico, mexico sued the manufacturers alleging they failed to impose controls on their distribution networks to prevent illegal sales to Mexican traffickers."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Defendant manufacturers",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3bf648c8d88b1204f354168f13ac94f67f750f69238f07786c7992e063eb7a66",
